  "body": "For years (decades?) Synapse has always returned `M_GUEST_ACCESS_FORBIDDEN` for `/initialSync` when the room isn't peekable, however 1.11 changed that to be `M_FORBIDDEN` .\r\n\r\nThe spec is, per usual, not very helpful here. Guest access errors seem most relevant given you aren't in the room yet and are in fact acting as a guest.",
